#: lib/tymeslot_saas_web/live/compare_live/competitors/acuity.ex:29
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Acuity Scheduling is a long-established, deeply featured booking tool (intake forms, packages, memberships, classes, gift certificates), now part of Squarespace. It suits established service businesses that want all of that in one place and don't mind paying from day one (there's no free tier, only a trial) on staff-count-based plans. Tymeslot covers the core scheduling job (booking pages, two-way calendar sync, automatic video links, reminders, payments) with a real free plan, flat pricing, EU hosting, first-class CalDAV and an open-source, self-hostable core."
msgstr ""

#: lib/tymeslot_saas_web/live/compare_live/competitors/acuity.ex:37
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Acuity earned its reputation: it's a mature, deeply featured booking system, and for an established salon, clinic or studio that needs intake forms, packages, memberships and classes in one place, it's a capable choice.\n\nThe friction is cost and openness. There's no free plan, only a 7-day trial, and the paid tiers are priced by staff and calendar count, with common needs like SMS reminders and branding removal pushed to higher tiers. And because it's closed, US-hosted SaaS, there's no self-hosting, no EU data residency, and no generic CalDAV.\n\nTymeslot is the leaner, open alternative: a real free plan, flat pricing that doesn't punish you for adding people, EU hosting (or self-host anywhere), first-class CalDAV and tracker-free booking pages. If you don't need Acuity's heavier all-in-one feature set, Tymeslot covers the core scheduling job for far less, or nothing."
msgstr ""

#: lib/tymeslot_saas_web/live/compare_live/competitors/acuity.ex:242
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Acuity is a heavier all-in-one tool with mature intake forms, packages, memberships, class scheduling and gift certificates. If your business depends on that full suite, Acuity may fit better. Tymeslot focuses on doing core scheduling — booking, sync, reminders, payments — cleanly, for free or a flat fee."
msgstr ""

